-- Agreement — Kenny Shin (Birmingham Branch Operator), effective
-- October 15, 2026. Text as on the signed paper copy provided 2026-10-15
-- (pages put back in reading order: cover, recitals, Articles 1–11,
-- signatures, Exhibit A).
--
-- Signatures (HR Paperworks → Custom Forms):
--   * Subcontractor — Kenny Shin signed on paper on 10/15/2026 (his AHS
--     account is inactive). HR submits the form: his part is pre-filled as
--     "Signed on paper (original on file)", 10/15/2026,
--     with an optional upload for the signed scan.
--   * Company — "Filled in by: Company", locked to Justin Lee's account
--     (CEO): he signs from Submissions → Complete; everyone else sees
--     "Waiting for Justin Lee to sign." The finished document is saved once
--     he signs.
--
